* Kuijk bandgap, topology kuijk-p5t-mirror, PDK synth180, round 1
.subckt bandgap_lb vdd vss en ibias vbg go g
XQ1 vss vss a spnp 
XQ2_1 vss vss c spnp 
XQ2_2 vss vss c spnp 
XQ2_3 vss vss c spnp 
XQ2_4 vss vss c spnp 
XQ2_5 vss vss c spnp 
XQ2_6 vss vss c spnp 
XQ2_7 vss vss c spnp 
XQ2_8 vss vss c spnp 
XR1 b c vss sres r_length=30.75u r_width=2u s=3
XR2a vbg a vss sres r_length=39.63u r_width=2u s=23
XR2b vbg b vss sres r_length=39.63u r_width=2u s=23
XMB0 ibias ibias vdd vdd pch33 w=3.89u l=5u
XMT tail ibias vdd vdd pch33 w=7.78u l=5u
XM3 d1 d1 ls vss nch33 w=9.29u l=40u
XMO vbg g vdd vdd pch33 w=7.01u l=2u
XMSU1 su ibias vdd vdd pch33 w=0.22u l=5.66u
XMSU2 su vbg vss vss nch33 w=0.5u l=20u
XMSU3 g su sux vss nch33 w=1u l=1u
XMSU4 sux en vss vss nch33 w=1u l=1u
XMEN1 ibias en vdd vdd pch33 w=1u l=1u
XMEN2 g en vdd vdd pch33 w=1u l=1u
XMEN3 ls en vss vss nch33 w=1u l=1u
XM1 d1 a tail vdd pch33 w=86.17u l=10u
XM2 o1 b tail vdd pch33 w=86.17u l=10u
XM4 o1 d1 ls vss nch33 w=9.29u l=40u
XM5 go o1 ls vss nch33 w=10.7u l=40u
XM6 go go vdd vdd pch33 w=1.75u l=2u
XCC o1 vss scap c_length=70.71u c_width=70.71u
.ends bandgap_lb

.subckt bandgap vdd vss en ibias vbg
xlb vdd vss en ibias vbg g g bandgap_lb
.ends bandgap
